/Title (The first step was to map major tribal land areas in the Pacific Northwest. These lands are the center of the analysis. There are 43 recognized tribes in this region. The number of tribes was narrowed down to 10,000 acres or larger for the feasibility of biomass potential for the land area.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 994 0 R
